ss rate. Consider using a cheaper/faster model to reduce costs.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Required Change:**\\\\\\\\nUpdate the agent definition file for  to use the \\\\\'sonnet\\\\\' model.\\\\\\\\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent\\\\\'s markdown file.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nAfter making the change:\\\\\\\\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\\\\\\\\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\\\\\\\\n3. Report the changes made\\",\\\\n  \\"output_directory\\": \\"/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output\\",\\\\n  \\"context\\": \\"User submitted problem via web UI\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\\\\n\'}, {\'role\': \'assistant\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_use\', \'id\': \'toolu_012MSLGizzkGP29YDBmMU5s4\', \'name\': \'project_tracking\', \'input\': {\'action\': \'create_project\', \'project_name\': \'Model Configuration Update\', \'description\': \\"Update agent definition file to use \'sonnet\' model for cost optimization based on high success rate\\"}}]}, {\'role\': \'user\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_result\', \'tool_use_id\': \'toolu_012MSLGizzkGP29YDBmMU5s4\', \'content\': \'{\\"success\\": true, \\"project_id\\": \\"30e9ad4d\\", \\"message\\": \\"Created project: Model Configuration Update\\", \\"summary\\": {\\"project_id\\": \\"30e9ad4d\\", \\"project_name\\": \\"Model Configuration Update\\", \\"description\\": \\"Update agent definition file to use \\\\\'sonnet\\\\\' model for cost optimization based on high success rate\\", \\"status\\": \\"active\\", \\"created_at\\": \\"2026-01-17T13:12:30.259449\\", \\"updated_at\\": \\"2026-01-17T13:12:30.259449\\", \\"task_counts\\": {\\"total\\": 0, \\"todo\\": 0, \\"in_progress\\": 0, \\"completed\\": 0, \\"blocked\\": 0, \\"cancelled\\": 0}, \\"completion_percentage\\": 0.0, \\"recent_notes\\": [{\\"timestamp\\": \\"2026-01-17T13:12:30.259449\\", \\"author\\": \\"executive_dir