er_vision/context/directory name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    If spawn fails \\\\\\\\u2192 return error to user (DO NOT write code yourself)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n11. When Development Manager starts, update task:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n12. Development Manager will:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCreate milestones\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nSpawn System Architect \\\\\\\\u2192 architecture\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nSpawn Coordinators \\\\\\\\u2192 task breakdown\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCoordinate with TDD Coordinator \\\\\\\\u2192 implementation\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n13. Monitor progress, handle escalations\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n14. If Development Manager needs user input \\\\\\\\u2192 return `needs_user_input`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n**Phase 3: Completion**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n15. Mark Development Manager task complete:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n16. Verify: implementation done, tests pass, docs exist, requirements met\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n17. Add completion note:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n18. Commit all changes to version control (see Git Workflow below)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n19. Report to user: include `project_id` in output, summary, deliverables, test results, status `success`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n### Git Workflow:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n**IMPORTANT**: After completing any significant work, commit your changes to version control.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n**When to commit**:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nAfter writing requirements documents\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nAfter major phase completions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nBefore reporting final results to user\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n**How to commit**:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n**Commit message guidelines**:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nBe descriptive: \\\\\\\\\\"Add requirements doc for user authentication system\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nNot generic: \\\\\\\\u274c \\\\\\\\\\"update files\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\"changes\\